>> x := Wanta haaraa.
>> y := Wanta haaraa.
>> z := x.
Baʼii barreessi: (x = z), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (x = y), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (x ≠ y), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (x ≠ z), dhaabi.
>> m := Yeroo haaraa bara: 2070, jiʼa: 11.
>> n := m kopii.
Baʼii barreessi: (m = n), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (m ≠ n), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (m isuma-tokko: m), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (m isuma-tokko: n), dhaabi.
n jiʼa: 12.
Baʼii barreessi: (m ≠ n), dhaabi.
Baʼii barreessi: (m = n), dhaabi.


